19988 0 obj
  << /ActualText (How to Export Your AI Org Chart to PNG \046 PDF\n\nExport Instructions for FigJam\n\nExporting to PNG\072\n\nSelect the AI Org Chart Section\050Click directly on the section title \050top\055left corner\051 to ensure the entire AI Org Chart section is selected\056\nOpen Export Menu\050With the section selected\054 click the \042Export\042 button in the floating toolbar that appears near the selection\056\nChoose Format and Export\050From the export options\054 select \042PNG\042\056\050Click the \042Export\042 button\056 Your PNG file will download immediately\056\n\nExporting to PDF\072\n\nOpen Export Options\050Click the menu icon \050\357\051 located at the top\055right corner of your FigJam board\056\nSelect Export as PDF\050In the drop down menu\054 choose \042Export\042 and then \042Export as PDF\042\056\nConfirm Export Area\050Ensure the option for the correct area or section \050Current view or Current selection\051 is selected\056\nExport PDF\050Click \042Export\042\054 and your PDF file will download to your device\056)
     /K [ 653 ]
     /P 19989 0 R
     /Pg 18683 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
